<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CENTRAL BANK NO REPO TENDER FOR THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>CZECH CENTRAL BANK NO REPO TENDER FOR THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said in a statement that it will not hold a repo tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>It made no further comment.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the CNB held a one-week repo tender with the maximum rate set at 12.4 percent. Dealers on the Czech forex market said they thought the central bank may raise its repo rate on Thursday to help prop up a sagging crown.</p>
</text>
